      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Equipped vehicle may drop one per turn, in same manner as a bomb. Stays in play &apos;til end of turn. Any unit, targetting an enemy unit which is within 12&quot; of the Flare, gains Night Vision for that Shooting phase.</characteristic>
